/p><h2>Reports</h2><p>A VPR Vehicle Interest Search Report records the VPR search result at a particular date and time. It is an information report and is not proof of ownership or statutory perfection or priority.</p><h2>Misuse</h2><p>Users must not knowingly submit false information, attempt unauthorised access, interfere with VPR systems or use VPR information unlawfully.</p><h2>Corrections</h2><p>Affected parties may request review or correction of a VPR record.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>info@vpr.co.zw<br>secure@vpr.co.zw<br>+263 788 444 409<br>10 Shepperton Road, Graniteside, Harare</p><p><a href="index.php">Return to VPR</a></p></main></body></html>